'''Decay''' is a [[debuff]] which causes affected targets to take [[chaos damage]] over time.

==Mechanics==
Decay is a damaging debuff that deals chaos damage over time. It is not a [[skill]] or [[ailment]], and it is not a skill effect for the purpose of modifiers to {{c|mod|Skill Effect Duration}}. 

When the Decay debuff is built into a skill through {{il|Decay Support}}, or into all skills by a global on-hit effect such as {{il|Essence of Delirium}}'s weapon modifier, Decay's damage will scale with the stats of the skill that inflicts it, including from that skill's [[support gem]]s. Sources of Decay that do ''not'' incorporate it into a skill (e.g. {{il|Chalice of Horrors}}) are affected by global stats only. 

==Sources==
